// cjk-demo — CJK (Chinese) line breaking in texish.
//
// Render with:  texish-cli scripts/cjk-demo.script
//
// texish breaks paragraphs the way Knuth TeX does — at spaces, penalties and
// discretionaries. Chinese text has no interword spaces, so a run of it used to
// arrive at the line breaker as one box and overflow the measure. The engine now
// offers a break between adjacent CJK characters (as stretchable glue, so the line
// can still justify) and applies kinsoku: a closing mark never starts a line, an
// opening mark never ends one. The line breaker itself is unchanged.
//
// A CJK font is not bundled with texish, so this demo loads one from disk with the
// new \loadfont primitive. The path below is a macOS system font; change it to any
// CJK .ttf/.otf/.ttc on your machine.

\use{document}

\loadfont {cjk} {/System/Library/Fonts/Supplemental/Songti.ttc}

\title{Chinese Typesetting in \TeXish}
\author{The texish engine}
\maketitle

\section{The problem}

Knuth's line breaker finds breaks at glue, penalties and discretionary hyphens. Latin
prose is full of interword glue, so it wraps naturally; a long word is split by Liang
hyphenation. Chinese, written without spaces between characters, offers the breaker
nothing to work with — the whole paragraph is one rigid box, and it runs off the edge of
the page. The fix, following \texttt{xeCJK} and \texttt{luatexja} on the Unicode \TeX{}
engines, is to insert the missing break opportunities between characters before the
breaker runs.

\section{The result}

Below is a paragraph of Chinese set at twelve points. Every character is its own box, with
a thin, stretchable space between neighbours; the breaker chooses where to wrap and
stretches the inter-character spaces so each line reaches the right margin.

\medskip

{\font cjk 12 regular
这是一个关于中文排版的示例。texish 引擎现在能够在没有空格的情况下，把一整段中文文字断成多行，
并且让每一行都对齐到右边的页边。每两个汉字之间都插入了一个宽度为零、但是可以伸缩的间隔，所以行末
既不会溢出版心，也不会留下难看的空白。断行的位置遵守禁则：句号、逗号、问号等收尾的标点不会被排在
一行的开头，而左括号「这样的起首符号也不会被留在一行的末尾，它们总是跟随相邻的汉字一起移动。}

\medskip

\noindent The same paragraph wraps correctly at any measure, so it also works inside the
narrower column of a quotation:

\begin{quote}
{\font cjk 12 regular
排版引擎把每个汉字当作一个独立的盒子，在盒子之间放入可伸缩的胶水，于是克努特的断行算法不需要任何
改动，就能像处理英文那样处理中文，并且在两端对齐。}
\end{quote}
